Package: LocalVolatility
Type: Package
Title: Pricing Engines for Local Volatility Models
Version: 3.1.0
Date: 2026-04-06
Encoding: UTF-8
Authors@R: 
	person("Alejandro", "Olguin", email = "alejandro_olguin@icloud.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Option pricing engines for local and stochastic volatility models, implemented
	in C++ via Rcpp. Finite-difference PDE solvers for 1D and 2D (European and American) with
	Heston stochastic volatility. Monte Carlo 4D engine for double-Heston quanto options
	(equity + FX, each with stochastic vol) using Longstaff-Schwartz for American exercise
	and std::thread parallelism. Includes Tavella-Randall grids, Yanenko operator splitting,
	penalty method, and calibration-optimized batch solvers.
